;;;; Thailand — Buddhist days of the Thai lunar calendar as the BOT and
;;;; Cabinet lists print them, 2000-2027. :listed names the days a list
;;;; prints; the others (a day on a weekend with no substitute named) are
;;;; the Thai lunar rule's (thai-lunar-rule-day). :type is the rule's year type,
;;;; which the listed dates imply (athikamat: Asalha(Y-1) -> Makha(Y) 30 days longer;
;;;; athikawan: Visakha -> Asalha 60 days).

